{"id": "2350173", "name": "מציאת מד\"ר מסדר ראשון לפתרון הנתון בצורה סתומה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה פונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(x)\\)</span> בצורה סתומה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}=0 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו פונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)\\)</span> של שתי משתנים כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(x)\\)</span> היא פתרון למד\"ר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y'(x)=f(x,y(x)) \\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(f(x,y)= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> גוזרים את המשוואה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U(x,y(x))=0\\)</span> לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> (גזירה סתומה) ומבודדים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — גזירה סתומה</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</span>. הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(x)\\)</span> מקיימת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\big(x,y(x)\\big)=0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>, ולכן גם הנגזרת לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> מתאפסת. לפי כלל השרשרת:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ U_x+U_y\\cdot y'=0 \\]</p>כאשר<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ U_x={{CT:1}},\\qquad U_y={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — בידוד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'\\)</span></b><br>בנקודות שבהן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U_y\\neq 0\\)</span> מבודדים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y'=-\\frac{U_x}{U_y} \\]</p>ולכן אפשר לבחור<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x,y)={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: is(trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(ans1-ta)))=0);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["U", "a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "a5", "a6", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}